---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { Card } from '@weluvabid/iris/components';
import { withBase } from '@lib/journal';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Journal" description="A little about the engineer behind Journal.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground">About</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">
      I like understanding how things work.
    </h1>
    <div class="prose-journal mt-8">
      <p>
        Hello! I am a software engineer and love creating products, I also love solving problems and
        can often get too caught up in things.
      </p>
      <p>
        I’m very product orientated. I like understanding why we are building something. I enjoy
        discussing designs and finding the areas that could be improved. I enjoy thinking about edge
        cases and putting myself in the customers shoes. Sometimes a quick discussion on what we
        need to build can help prevent any issues.
      </p>
      <p>
        I really value clean code. I don’t like making developers do unnecessary work that could be
        automated by the bundler. I’m not a fan of "clever" code. I would much rather have simple
        code that can be tested and easily understood by a junior developer.
      </p>
      <p>
        A lot of my personal projects come from curiosity. I will often want to try something new or
        understand how something works. Some of these become actual projects but others are just to
        help me learn what I want. I also contribute to open source as I enjoy working on things
        outside of my own projects.
      </p>
    </div>
    <Card.Root class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/40">
      <Card.Header
        ><Card.Title>Explore the work</Card.Title><Card.Description
          >Browse the projects or follow the reasoning behind them in the Journal.</Card.Description
        ><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-3">
          <a class="text-sm font-medium underline underline-offset-4" href={withBase('/projects/')}
            >Projects</a
          ><a class="text-sm font-medium underline underline-offset-4" href={withBase('/journal/')}
            >Journal entries</a
          >
        </div></Card.Header
      >
    </Card.Root>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
